es is vast, ranging from light-hearted party games that rely on humor to more complex games that require significant mental investment. It’s always a unique experience exploring different genres, and I’m curious if you have any favorites that you look forward to playing or any that have left a lasting impression on you for their fun mechanics or engaging storytelling."], "document_offset": 0, "logical_document_count": 2, "physical_batch_limit": 4, "score_contract": "pointwise", "score_space": "unit_interval", "sequence": 928, "elapsed_seconds": 98.51402401924133}
