al observation order; not calendar time)\\n\", \"source_role\": \"unknown\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s2\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:e7a026a1e699694225904ac735e54f242d28ca85da0c2e3ea86daf04d7e3237a\", \"start\": 99, \"end\": 105, \"text\": \"User:\\n\", \"source_role\": \"unknown\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s3\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:e7a026a1e699694225904ac735e54f242d28ca85da0c2e3ea86daf04d7e3237a\", \"start\": 105, \"end\": 478, \"text\": \"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [43]}, {\"id\": \"s4\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:e7a026a1e699694225904ac735e54f242d28ca85da0c2e3ea86daf04d7e3237a\", \"start\": 478, \"end\": 845, \"text\": \"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [43]}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:e7a026a1e699694225904ac735e54f242d28ca85da0c2e3ea86daf04d7e3237a\", \"start\": 845, \"end\": 858, \"text\": \"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\", \"source_role\": \"unknown\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:e7a026a1e699694225904ac735e54f242d28ca85da0c2e3ea86daf04d7e3237a\", \"start\": 858, \"end\": 1223, \"text\": \"Assistant: That’s an inspiring mindset! The journey of creatin